   {
    "f": "notes",
    "old": "Loaded Dice. A behavior (not a bare value) because loadedDiceMultiplier itself calls applyTwistOfFate(state) on its favorable roll -- a real pre-existing state write, carried over unchanged. 'variance' bucket -- its own resolved number IS the raw multiplier (0.5/1/2.0), not an additive delta, matching critMultiplier's own convention and spec §4's 'stays as a product' note.",
    "new": "Loaded Dice. A behavior (not a bare value) because loadedDiceMultiplier itself dispatches applyAndReact.onFavorableRoll (Twist of Fate) on its favorable roll -- a real pre-existing state write, carried over unchanged. 'variance' bucket -- its own resolved number IS the raw multiplier (0.5/1/2.0), not an additive delta, matching critMultiplier's own convention and spec §4's 'stays as a product' note."
